            title: `The Digital Office`,
            subtitle: `An administrative technician has four weeks to bring the office of an installation company in Salamanca up to date: how invoices come in and are approved, who watches the official notifications, how customers sign, what is automated with AI tools and what is done with personal data and the paper that must be kept.`,
